## Interface: 16001
## Title: Efficient Quests
## Notes: A step-by-step leveling guide for the Forever client.
## Version: 0.3.0
## OptionalDeps: FlareUI, TomTom, QuestieDB
## SavedVariables: EfficientQuestsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: EfficientQuestsCharacter

# The embedded libraries load first, in dependency order: HereBeDragons
# needs LibStub and CallbackHandler. The pins part of HereBeDragons is
# not embedded, because pins draw on maps.
Libs/LibStub/LibStub.lua
Libs/CallbackHandler-1.0/CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs/HereBeDragons/HereBeDragons-2.0.lua
Core.lua

# The quest state reader loads right after the entry point, before every
# module that asks it questions or subscribes to its callbacks.
QuestState.lua

# Interface.lua is the old window module. It stays in this folder as a
# frozen reference for the new step window and is never loaded.
